Py3Moin requirements
====================

This fork requires Python 3.10 or later. Install a source checkout with
``python -m pip install .`` in a virtual environment. The package metadata
in ``pyproject.toml`` defines supported versions of Werkzeug, passlib,
html-sanitizer, Pygments, parsedatetime, flup, future, and pytest. Pip
installs them automatically. The optional OpenID dependency is available
with ``python -m pip install '.[openid]'``.

See docs/PYTHON3.rst for server setup, optional services, and the Python
versions exercised by CI. The historical MoinMoin 1.9 installation notes
apply to upstream Python 2 releases.
